# profile_pocket_arc.cam — engine-comp arc-emission fixture (inside / concave case).
# The L-profile is wound CCW, so the tool cuts *inside* it (the winding
# convention, DECISIONS.md "Row-2.4 `side` selector"). Offsetting inward by the
# tool radius rounds the single reflex corner at (60,40) into a fillet arc of
# radius = tool radius (5) — emitted as one true G03 move, the rest straight
# G01. The straight-only Window fixture (profile_pocket.cam) offsets arc-free; this is
# its rounded sibling, pinning G02/G03 emission (DECISIONS.md "Arc emission…").
units mm
feed 800
plunge 300
rapid_z 5
clearance_z 25
spindle 3000

stock Box(w=120, l=80, h=20, x=0, y=0, z=0)

tool T5 Endmill(dia=10.0)

feature Lprofile ProfilePocket(extent=0.5
    0 0
    120 0
    120 80
    60 80
    60 40
    0 40
)

run Side(tool=T5, surface=Lprofile)
